# A and B held in the picture, in the inventory and across a change of screen: only the moment of the press counts.

# The logos, the title, a new game, and the opening text.
.:900 T:4 .:300
A:4 .:300
40x A:3 .:60
.:120

# Up twice leaves the commands for the picture, where the cursor moves a pixel a frame. With B held, and then with A.
U:3 .:20 U:3 .:20 .:30 BU:30 BR:12 .:30 AL:10 .:120
# Press A through what that click opened.
6x A:3 .:90
# Right, with B held, across the picture and on into the inventory on its right, then down.
BR:200 .:30 BD:40 .:60
# Back out to the left, and A on what's under it, held from the click into the message it opens.
L:120 .:30 A:200 .:240
6x A:3 .:90
